{
"dur": 37.783,
"shots": [
{
"i": 1,
"start": 0.0,
"vo_start": 0.6,
"vo_end": 8.014,
"text": "A US senator later writes that the chips started flowing after an American supplier met a former state media reporter among Megaspeed's executives.",
"end": 8.289
},
{
"i": 2,
"start": 8.289,
"vo_start": 8.564,
"vo_end": 14.353,
"text": "And according to reports, she raises money for Megaspeed by posting photos of herself with Jensen Huang.",
"end": 14.628
},
{
"i": 3,
"start": 14.628,
"vo_start": 14.903,
"vo_end": 24.395,
"text": "A year after the bar, at Computex 2025, Jensen stops for the cameras. If you look closely, the woman standing right behind him is Alice Huang.",
"end": 24.67
},
{
"i": 4,
"start": 24.67,
"vo_start": 24.945,
"vo_end": 32.872,
"text": "That week, after a dinner with AI suppliers, the two of them are seen leaving a restaurant together. What happens between them in private isn't public.",
"end": 33.147
},
{
"i": 5,
"start": 33.147,
"vo_start": 33.422,
"vo_end": 36.833,
"text": "So who is the man she bet on? And why would China want him?",
"end": 37.783
}
],
